// pkg/orm/relautox/relautox.bit — R2b (#6322, epic #6298) live acceptance
// fixture: `relAutoXTouchAuthorName` lives in THIS module, a DIFFERENT
// module (SPEC §17.1: a directory is one module) than `pkg/orm` (which
// declares `RelAutoPost` and runs the query) or `./relautoc`
// (`relautoc.test.bit`, which calls this function ACROSS the module
// boundary with a NAMED argument, `post = post`).
//
// `RelAutoPost` stays declared in `pkg/orm` itself, imported here rather
// than redeclared: a `@table` class declared OUTSIDE pkg/orm's own
// directory needs `compiler/classtablerelation.bit`'s synthesized
// `__loadRelation`/`__linkRelation` statics to import "orm" by PACKAGE
// name (`tableRelationImportDecl`, that file) — a self-import this
// in-tree package cannot resolve (`moduleIsPkgOrm`'s own header there: a
